      "ability": "woocommerce/plan-batch-operation",
      "namespace_owner": "woocommerce/woocommerce",
      "source_url": "",
      "schema_hash": "sha256:3ed81faceb12b60667f5088e1b81c423cda3bf4a86bb7ffe5e46fd59cf2fc26f",
      "scope": "propose",
      "reversibility": 0.5,
      "personas": [
        "marketing",
        "pricing",
        "inventory",
        "sales-support"
      ],
      "description": "Resolve selector, freeze operation items, and return a dry-run preview. The selector accepts either inline attribute filters (selector.type \"product_query\") for simple cases like categories/price/stock, or a selector_handle from find-products (selector.type \"find_result\") for behavioral queries like slow movers, margin bands, or data-quality issues. Returns operation_uuid that the user may approve via UI without invoking confirm-batch-operation here; if the user later asks whether the operation ran or what the outcome was, call get-batch-operation-status with that operation_uuid to check."
    },
    {
      "ability": "woocommerce/confirm-batch-operation",
      "namespace_owner": "woocommerce/woocommerce",
      "source_url": "",
      "schema_hash": "sha256:4f4fb6498c679ce5b5a6066e80f85d8c167d75852186b59a0a80151214431079",
