      "description": "Read operation state and progress counters. Use this to check whether a previously planned batch operation has been executed or completed — the user may approve and run an operation directly via the preview UI without a tool round-trip, so call this with the operation_uuid from plan-batch-operation to verify outcomes. Terminal states: succeeded, partially_succeeded, failed, cancelled."
