        "marketing",
        "pricing",
        "inventory",
        "sales-support"
      ],
      "description": "Resolve products by attribute filters (category, price, stock, …) and/or behavioral filters (slow_mover, margin, data_issues). Returns a `selector_handle` for the next step plus a preview of `{product_id, name}` rows. Two main use cases: (1) staging a bulk update — pass the handle to plan-batch-operation as `selector: { type: \"find_result\", handle }`; (2) \"show me what you found\" — bump `preview_size` (default 10, up to 500) so the merchant sees every match listed by name without going through plan."
    },
